# Remotrix commit template
# Format: type(scope): 中文描述 (English summary)
# types: feat, fix, perf, refactor, style, docs, build, ci, chore, test, revert

# Example:
# feat(notify): 添加 Windows Toast 通知支持 (add Windows toast notifications)
#
# Keep the subject under ~72 chars. Add a body below only to explain "why".